          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisya, Yeova nũkũmĩtw’ĩkĩthya nthĩ nthei, na kũmyananga, na kũmĩkuluman’ya, na kũnyaĩĩkya ala mamĩtwĩe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa, o tondũ kũilyĩ kwa andũ, now’o kwa mũthembi; o tondũ kũilyĩ kwa mũthũkũmi, now’o kwa vwana wake; o tondũ kũilyĩ kwa mwĩĩtu mũthũkũmi, now’o kwa vivi wake; o tondũ kũilyĩ kwa ũla ũthooaa, now’o kwa mũthoosya; o tondũ kũilyĩ kwa ũla ũkovethasya, now’o kwa ũla ũkovethaw’a; o tondũ kũilyĩ kwa ũla wosaa ũtandĩthyo, now’o kwa ũla ũmũtandĩthĩasya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
